WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.952
Bu qismda ikki mashhur tenglama — Lagranj va Klero tenglamalarini ko‘ramiz.

2
00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:12.456
Klero tenglamasida to‘g‘ri chiziqlar oilasi va bitta maxsus egri chiziq paydo bo‘ladi.

3
00:00:12.456 --> 00:00:20.006
Shuningdek, nomzodni maxsus yechim deb atashdan oldin nimani tekshirish kerakligini bilib olasiz.

4
00:00:20.256 --> 00:00:26.688
Lagranj tenglamasi: y teng x ko‘paytirilgan fi p dan, qo‘shuv psi p dan.

5
00:00:26.688 --> 00:00:32.952
Uni differensiallasak, x ning p ga bog‘liqligi uchun chiziqli tenglama chiqadi.

6
00:00:32.952 --> 00:00:39.926
Agar fi p teng p bo‘lsa, Klero tenglamasini olamiz: y teng x p qo‘shuv psi p.

7
00:00:40.176 --> 00:00:45.744
Misol: y teng x y shtrix minus y shtrix kvadrat.

8
00:00:45.744 --> 00:00:52.128
Differensiallaymiz: p teng p qo‘shuv, x minus ikki p, ko‘paytirilgan p shtrix.

9
00:00:52.128 --> 00:00:57.120
Demak, x minus ikki p ko‘paytirilgan p shtrix nolga teng.

10
00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.726
Ikki holat bor.

11
00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:04.128
Birinchi holat: p shtrix nol, ya’ni p teng C.

12
00:01:04.128 --> 00:01:09.888
Umumiy yechim — to‘g‘ri chiziqlar: y teng C x minus C kvadrat.

13
00:01:09.888 --> 00:01:15.000
Ikkinchi holat: x teng ikki p, ya’ni p teng x ning yarmi.

14
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.752
Qo‘ysak, y teng x kvadratning to‘rtdan biri chiqadi.

15
00:01:19.752 --> 00:01:22.430
Bu maxsus yechim.

16
00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:31.536
Grafikda parabola y teng x kvadratning to‘rtdan biri va C ning bir nechta qiymatidagi to‘g‘ri chiziqlar ko‘rsatilgan.

17
00:01:31.536 --> 00:01:36.312
Har bir chiziq parabolaga x teng ikki C nuqtada urinadi.

18
00:01:36.312 --> 00:01:40.128
Parabola — chiziqlar oilasining o‘ramasi.

19
00:01:40.128 --> 00:01:47.630
Uning har bir nuqtasidan ikki yechim bir xil og‘ish bilan o‘tadi, shuning uchun yagonalik buziladi.

20
00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:55.680
Maxsus yechim har doim p-diskriminant chiziqda yotadi: F nolga va F ning p bo‘yicha hosilasi nolga teng.

21
00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:58.536
Lekin teskarisi noto‘g‘ri!

22
00:01:58.536 --> 00:02:07.608
Masalan, y teng ikki x y shtrix minus y shtrix kvadrat uchun diskriminant chiziq y teng x kvadrat,

23
00:02:07.608 --> 00:02:10.704
ammo u umuman yechim emas.

24
00:02:10.704 --> 00:02:18.494
Shuning uchun har doim tekshiring: bu yechimmi, va uning har bir nuqtasida yagonalik buziladimi.

25
00:02:18.744 --> 00:02:24.518
O‘zingizni tekshiring: p-diskriminant chiziq haqida qaysi gap to‘g‘ri?
